## Position Duties (7 October 2026)

As an Environment Technical Artist, you operate at the crossroads of environment art, level design and technical constraints. Your mission is to ensure urban and architectural environments are modular, performant and gameplay ready within Unreal Engine 5. Regular on site presence is expected. Partial remote work is possible.

Responsibilities
- Implement modular architectural and urban environment assets
- Work with Construction Scripts and Blueprint based workflows
- Ensure clean technical setup of meshes, materials and prefabs
- Maintain scale, proportions and spatial consistency
- Troubleshoot environment related technical issues
- Collaborate with Environment Art, Level Design and Tech teams
- Ensure environments meet gameplay and performance constraints

## Candidate Profile (7 October 2026)

Requirements
- Strong experience with Unreal Engine
- Understanding of modular environment workflows
- Solid architectural and spatial sense
- Ability to debug technical setup issues
- Strong communication and collaboration skills
- Portfolio focused on environment or architectural work
- Fluent or professional working proficiency in English (written and spoken)

